Description: GTK4 comic book viewer (Rust port)
 MComix-rs is a user-friendly, customizable comic book image viewer.
 It is specifically designed to handle comic books (both Western
 comics and manga) and supports a variety of container formats
 including CBR, CBZ, CB7, CBT, LHA and PDF.
 .
 MComix-rs is the Rust/GTK4 port of the MComix3 comic book reader.
